    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "chair",
        "speaker": "Chair",
        "sourceStart": 7,
        "sourceEnd": 94,
        "text": "We have three proposals for the old station site. Can your student group recommend one?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "16cb50ad049de346fd97719d1cdea986dcdf4c24112c5f10454d0ef9ddd45a8e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "alex",
        "speaker": "Alex",
        "sourceStart": 101,
        "sourceEnd": 212,
        "text": "We can compare them against stated criteria. We cannot claim that our own preference represents the whole town.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "1c647879780dd4ef2bdd2f31ac4163aded6814bf8a46148855a32f9ee8b36878",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "chair",
        "speaker": "Chair",
        "sourceStart": 220,
        "sourceEnd": 246,
        "text": "What criteria did you use?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "c8b44ce7595e93710e6bd819f7d9a6983cbf5800bb2d0a1f593e8e332854d380",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "alex",
        "speaker": "Alex",
        "sourceStart": 253,
        "sourceEnd": 435,
        "text": "Access, maintenance cost and space for informal activities. The original brief included visitor spending, but reliable estimates were unavailable, so we show that as an evidence gap.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "2be6a5ea6d7e5fe529da6f05d1667f91d32f8a27b547a460b206319297ed401b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "chair",
        "speaker": "Chair",
        "sourceStart": 443,
        "sourceEnd": 477,
        "text": "Which plan scored best for access?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "cddbe124393aca85867ac099d8cdb56294f975367793f69b33b39ee9d2fce8cf",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "alex",
        "speaker": "Alex",
        "sourceStart": 484,
        "sourceEnd": 638,
        "text": "Plan B, because its main entrance is level with the existing pavement. Plan A needs a ramp, and Plan C puts the entrance on the opposite side of the road.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "65f23798e36ee969b5ae7a004957f586a900f3bbb098fa5144b2b892f4f4c834",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "chair",
        "speaker": "Chair",
        "sourceStart": 646,
        "sourceEnd": 682,
        "text": "Does that make B the overall winner?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "4069a9c52c75124fe8a3995a85ebb40ef2798b1dd742df95d17882be91fe7890",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "alex",
        "speaker": "Alex",
        "sourceStart": 689,
        "sourceEnd": 864,
        "text": "Only if access receives the greatest weight. A different weighting could change the ranking. We have shown two alternatives rather than hiding the judgement in a single total.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "4b20b5f0deb9e9723a762e89aea0897019d075b71cd82961799106c210c9d709",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "chair",
        "speaker": "Chair",
        "sourceStart": 872,
        "sourceEnd": 911,
        "text": "What about the comments from residents?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "0ac5b36333e02dec37fdf4f9f94ea238a06982af030af9d7c8b3c7c87a014fb4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "alex",
        "speaker": "Alex",
        "sourceStart": 918,
        "sourceEnd": 1111,
        "text": "They identify concerns, particularly about evening lighting. But only fourteen people replied to the online form. We cannot convert those comments into a reliable percentage for the whole town.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "6e86bf47be2cd6a115815f9b03892ca9b8b549757d282c3fa34d018d3a7a68eb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "chair",
        "speaker": "Chair",
        "sourceStart": 1119,
        "sourceEnd": 1153,
        "text": "What is your final recommendation?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "dd5f5741306695a6cf0a637706d2422804ef465496341742ba8e3a30541db1a0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "alex",
        "speaker": "Alex",
        "sourceStart": 1160,
        "sourceEnd": 1326,
        "text": "Keep B for detailed design, check the maintenance estimate and arrange an accessible public meeting. The present comparison supports a next step, not a final mandate.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "07dcfe9ca3f64789621a76dfdb9f29156580a6d75be264835a39ea2efad38e98",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
